 Experimental Q does not send prompts, microphone recordings, personal memory,
 or telemetry to these projects. All included inference executes locally.
+
+## TensorFlow.js and COCO-SSD
+
+- Copyright The TensorFlow Authors. Apache-2.0.
+- Sources: https://github.com/tensorflow/tfjs and https://github.com/tensorflow/tfjs-models.
+- COCO-SSD lite_mobilenet_v2 detects general objects locally in the camera view.
+- Weights and graph are pinned by SHA-256 in installer/vision-model.lock.json.
+- License is included with the frontend at vision/LICENSE.txt.
